</tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="row-safe"><td class="nw"><code>3.2.2</code></td><td class="nw" data-sort="20210114">14 Jan 2021</td><td class="nw">Mk2 / Mk3</td><td class="nw"><span class="status status--ok">Last pre-regression release</span></td><td class="wide">Seeds generated on this or an earlier release used <code>ckcc.rng_bytes()</code> and are not affected by this generator substitution.</td></tr>
