<tr class="row-gone"><td class="nw"><code>5.0.0</code></td><td class="nw" data-sort="20220314">14 Mar 2022</td><td class="nw">Mk4</td><td class="nw"><span class="status status--bad">Affected</span></td><td class="wide">First Mk4 production firmware and the first to call <code>rng_seeding()</code> at boot, which is the 32-bit reseed.</td></tr>
